# What a build from the repository root may send to the builder. Only apps/relay/Dockerfile builds
# from here. Everything is left out, then the paths its COPY lines name are let back in, so a new
# local file is excluded by default. tools/arch/relayImage.test.mjs keeps this list equal to them.
*
!package.json
!pnpm-lock.yaml
!pnpm-workspace.yaml
!patches
!packages/protocol
!apps/relay
# Inside those paths, drop build output and anything shaped like a local credential. These come
# after the paths above because a later line wins.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.turbo
**/*.log
**/.env*
**/.npmrc
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
